OL,3,GNEWSAKnife found at school where
OL,4,Ateenager was murdered
OL,5,
OL,6,FA knife has been found in a pupil's bag
OL,7,Fat a Sheffield school where 15-year-old
OL,8,FHarvey Willgoose was stabbed to death
OL,9,Flast year.
OL,11,FPolice attended All Saints Catholic
OL,12,FHigh School, on Granville Road, just
OL,13,Fbefore 14:00 BST on Friday, after the
OL,14,Fknife was discovered during a bag
OL,15,Fsearch.
OL,17,FThe weapon was recovered and no
OL,18,Finjuries were reported, South Yorkshire
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
