OL,3,GNEWSAKnife found at school where
OL,4,Ateenager was murdered
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched and
OL,7,Fthe force said it was working with the
OL,8,Fschool to deal with the incident "in
OL,9,Fthe most appropriate manner".
